# BAB 3. Core and Platform Domain Schema

## 3.1 Overview

Bab ini mendesain basis data domain **Platform/Core** (SAD BAB 4.6): Organization, User, Security, Workflow, Master Data, dan Audit. Domain ini menyediakan fondasi yang dikonsumsi seluruh modul lain — khususnya **Organization Tree** dan **Scope-Based Access** yang menjadi basis `organization_id` pada Common Columns (BAB 2.4). Seluruh tabel mengikuti standar BAB 2.

---

## 3.2 Organization Management (`org_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.1 (BR-001 s.d. BR-0xx): hierarki tanpa batas level (BR-001), tipe organisasi konfigurabel (BR-002), parent–child (BR-003), lifecycle (BR-004), kode unik (BR-005).

```mermaid
erDiagram
  ORGANIZATION_TYPE ||--o{ ORGANIZATION : classifies
  ORGANIZATION ||--o{ ORGANIZATION : "parent-child"
  ORGANIZATION ||--o{ ORGANIZATION_CLOSURE : "ancestor/descendant"
  ORGANIZATION ||--o{ ORGANIZATION_ATTRIBUTE : has
```

### `org.organization_type` — DBS-008 applied

| Column        | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                         |
| ------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `code`        | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U   | Kode tipe (Holding, Company, Branch, dst.) — konfigurabel (BR-002). |
| `name`        | VARCHAR(150) | No   |     | Nama tipe organisasi.                               |
| `level_hint`  | INTEGER      | Yes  |     | Urutan/level indikatif (opsional, bukan pembatas).  |
| `is_active`   | BOOLEAN      | No   |     | Status aktif.                                       |

### `org.organization`

| Column           | Type         | Null | Key      | Description                                                    |
| ---------------- | ------------ | ---- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `code`           | VARCHAR(50)  | No   | U(org)   | Kode unik organisasi (BR-005), unik per scope induk/tenant.    |
| `name`           | VARCHAR(200) | No   |          | Nama organisasi (BR-006).                                      |
| `organization_type_id`| UUID    | No   | FK(→org.organization_type) | Tipe organisasi.                            |
| `parent_id`      | UUID         | Yes  | FK(→org.organization) | Induk (NULL = root); membentuk Organization Tree (BR-003). |
| `path`           | TEXT         | No   | IDX      | Materialized path (mis. `/root/sub/company`) untuk query scope. |
| `status`         | VARCHAR(20)  | No   |          | Lifecycle: Draft/Active/Inactive/Merge/Split/Archived (BR-004).|
| `effective_from` | DATE         | No   |          | Awal berlaku (DBS-016).                                        |
| `effective_to`   | DATE         | Yes  |          | Akhir berlaku.                                                 |

> Catatan: `organization_id` pada Common Columns tabel ini merujuk pada tenant/holding pemilik; `parent_id` merepresentasikan hierarki internal.

### `org.organization_closure` (closure table untuk traversal cepat)

| Column          | Type    | Null | Key | Description                                    |
| --------------- | ------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `ancestor_id`   | UUID    | No   | PK,FK| Leluhur.                                       |
| `descendant_id` | UUID    | No   | PK,FK| Keturunan.                                     |
| `depth`         | INTEGER | No   |     | Jarak level (0 = diri sendiri).                |

### `org.organization_attribute` (atribut fleksibel per tipe)

| Column        | Type         | Null | Key | Description                          |
| ------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------ |
| `organization_ref_id`| UUID  | No   | FK  | Organisasi terkait.                  |
| `attr_key`    | VARCHAR(100) | No   |     | Nama atribut.                        |
| `attr_value`  | JSONB        | No   |     | Nilai atribut (fleksibel).           |

**Indeks & partisi:** `uq_organization_org_code (organization_id, code)`; `idx_organization_parent (parent_id)`; `idx_organization_path (path)`. Tidak dipartisi (volume moderat).

