## 3.7 Audit Trail (`audit_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.20 (BR-826 s.d. BR-835): jejak audit immutable, konsumen seluruh event (SAD BAB 7.7). Tabel bersifat *append-only* & dipartisi RANGE per bulan (DBS-013).

### `audit.audit_log` (PARTITION BY RANGE (`occurred_at`))

| Column          | Type         | Null | Key | Description                                            |
| --------------- | ------------ | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `id`            | UUID         | No   | PK  | Identitas.                                             |
| `occurred_at`   | TIMESTAMPTZ  | No   | IDX | Waktu kejadian (kunci partisi).                        |
| `organization_id`| UUID        | No   | IDX | Scope organisasi.                                     |
| `actor_id`      | UUID         | Yes  |     | Pengguna pelaku.                                       |
| `action`        | VARCHAR(50)  | No   |     | Jenis aksi (create/update/delete/login/…).           |
| `entity_type`   | VARCHAR(100) | No   | IDX | Entitas terdampak.                                     |
| `entity_id`     | UUID         | Yes  |     | ID entitas terdampak.                                  |
| `before_value`  | JSONB        | Yes  |     | Nilai sebelum (BR-828).                                |
| `after_value`   | JSONB        | Yes  |     | Nilai sesudah.                                         |
| `reason`        | TEXT         | Yes  |     | Alasan/remarks (bila diperlukan).                     |
| `correlation_id`| UUID         | No   | IDX | Korelasi lintas layanan.                              |

> Tabel audit tidak menerima `UPDATE`/`DELETE` (immutable); retensi panjang (BAB 8.6).

